productGoal.statement:
The release workflow publishes docs.phax.run as a deterministic, offline rendering of the documentation the repository holds at the release tag:

- the README, split into guide pages by a committed page map;
- the CLI reference, security, release and the model catalog;
- the comparisons, and each blog post once the release it names has shipped.

Links are rewritten to site routes and checked. The site has a dark-first phax identity. Every released format's JSON Schema is served at the exact `$schema` URL phax writes, for every release, forever. CI builds the site on every change; only a release, or the author by hand, deploys it.

surface.after:
// site/pages.ts: the one place the site's structure lives; the README is never edited for it
export default {
  readme: [
    { route: "/", sections: ["(intro)", "Quickstart"] },
    { route: "/guide/install", title: "Install", sections: ["Install", "Runtime permission posture", "Shell completions"] },
    { route: "/guide/run", title: "Run a plan", sections: ["Run", "Resume", "Locks"] },
    // … one entry per route of the page tree
    { omit: ["CLI command reference"], why: "generated summary; /reference/cli is the full reference" },
  ],
  files: [
    { route: "/reference/cli", source: "docs/cli/reference.md" },
    { route: "/security", source: "docs/security.md" },
    { route: "/compare/openspec-vs-phax", source: "docs/comparisons/openspec-vs-phax.md" },
    { route: "/blog/announcing-phax-1-0", source: "docs/blog/announcing-phax-1.0.md", holdUntil: "1.0.0" },
  ],
};

{
  "releases": ["0.17.0"]
}
# after scripts/release.sh 0.18.0: { "releases": ["0.17.0", "0.18.0"] }, in the release commit
# normative: append-only; first entry = the first supported release; last entry = root package.json version; path indicative

{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "phax-docs",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-25",
  // no "main": static assets only, no Worker script
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./doc_build",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  },
  "preview_urls": true,
  "routes": [{ "pattern": "docs.phax.run", "custom_domain": true }]
}
